{"id":"n57641-1-13","stage":1,"title":"반찬 · 菜","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57641-1-13-1","ko":"엄마, 오늘 무슨 반찬을 이렇게 많이 차리셨어요?","zh":"妈妈，今天怎么准备了这么多菜呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"반찬을","meaning":"菜，菜肴","explanation":"반찬：菜，菜肴；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"반찬","audio":"/audio/dae8746e5842e5da92d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57641","senseId":"1","lemma":"반찬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반찬을","audio":"/audio/25c3d5e150ae2a815837.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceRead